2. **Empirical Null Model Construction**: Perform a non-parametric Kernel Density Estimation (KDE) of the radial satellite distribution using the provided `galaxy_catalog_XX.npy` and `halo_catalog_XX.npy`. This empirical KDE serves as the baseline "null" model to isolate higher-order structural anomalies from simple radial profile mismatches.

